  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "4db302cd-fb4f-4387-b88b-e8a7d95056f2",
      "title": "Olhe a imagem, escute a frase e ligue a cena ao sentido.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "356c65fc-910a-46a0-af5c-953183dca8ae",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a cena e a frase.</p><p><strong>Me gusta el café.</strong></p><p>Em português: Eu gosto de café.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/463f81c94bae4d29b8a6aef439f6c881_b01-me-gusta-el-cafe.png?Expires=1794099435&Signature=jroqXZmWjhso4CwO-DEb1cTpqanmKVr-KpC0jMXIaYCossDWTnzRaG93IZvyVSKCY3QaI9M6cTRMQtDIscsrJKVPoOtoBqCa0veLZE9rQD7119wR4dkPLrKyG7e-YFWxjvawk9zWeTE~4R24yNPNcE~WbTMjlMLU0NjXDyGcxCKARftR5~CvmdrBWmax~C5CgmaMYNVfYnwm5tCFsheQhzPp5Hs-UuUpIu79~dWNzD-Q1fK4Nq628wGAu7oZ7x2KRHnQwj-3S9BQhSh~06yD6uvFIOOB3ud~DQkBVYbtXxF86KvzZeZhkPPuuBHCDzSmEtE3QzZYzyzHTK7oABgg9g__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
