    {
      "id": "db32bec9-65ab-4575-8538-28a329d45071",
      "title": "Escute e compare as duas linhas antes de ler a explicação curta.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "f4cca1be-cc5b-4878-85e3-eeb567240cfa",
          "textContent": "<p>Compare as duas formas.</p><p><strong>Me gusta el café.</strong></p><p><strong>Me gustan los conciertos.</strong></p><p>Com <strong>uma coisa</strong>, aparece <strong>gusta</strong>. Com <strong>várias coisas</strong>, aparece <strong>gustan</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/e30cb553310f4487968ea2839144ff04_b04-gusta-vs-gustan.mp3?Expires=1794099435&Signature=ROk4sRncJNMkmBVK-fE1QU2ExS2A-f8JVJdEK03eqSz45UxO0LQjpedbaNI30xx4d72ap2B26N7SmVCiSOHnp282bgdwRTn8Aka5IluOrLERke0aAfTUXIgVbGqYEq9cqMvc3QvdIKlVHwbC46FeDsdbG61bPKMJ3Rmd1Jv5l1p-l8iGuaMnu25E7P75TxOxtSRW9fB9W8gQD3-vJ7Ao2xHoKLsGd00s-wxwmvBxofuzycSPFmdYC0e9u51Q1PYl1j7RDL3-SAsrPd78hlFElCA6NUpPUlpcr6lP7PWW2AKiMSVys3cnP~5ZlAIZ7Yu0BLVCIN2a1splOw3WwBEUpw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
