    },
    {
      "id": "57cc983f-1487-4737-a8b9-1186c6f8e540",
      "title": "Escute a frase e observe a palavra que muda o sentido.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "ca88e831-8ac3-4ba4-8160-bbd59e9cf5aa",
          "textContent": "<p>Para dizer que algo não agrada, entra <strong>no</strong>.</p><p><strong>No me gusta el tenis.</strong></p><p>Em português: Eu não gosto de tênis.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/a7056a9f807243cbb36e335565aa50f0_b05-no-me-gusta-el-tenis.mp3?Expires=1794099435&Signature=Y7RsH84RVl5FrmBRiSCfEbFoVHGwKfw1jAHPuHjwerE-W6paoGeUSUpKXDiZvZFg0djEIfPt0h9sNcWClAIshfbwaWogUwIHinhmiRsrhBushA8FoIMx1~xEfzZVdBL2UElbzgrdGb0Uk5uk-0lw6CN459zPKTGMvFrHPZgMXBdT72npTEpwVosVJnBvRwcHokUYeNhYID1p5XCZvX8o3KZe5ETIDlGonJ1lrQsLUO0KZoRi0~MnY6yiIvoGDvHmX0obAdJMSwJ1jY-iRpt68TYsb6cPNaZwo-fFyBC0WOxpNoMnlRBH9CCJIu4jfqK0NwywxwaraNotHN1FxvvzyQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
